  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Growing up in Choochy's Chop Shop, Wrench learned to fix anything that moved, or used to. After a scrap-heap explosion took most of his beak, he fashioned a new one from scrap metal, earning him the nickname 'Snaggle'. Now he wanders Subchain City, looking for lost tech and the perfect oil slick.",
    "class": "Mechanic",
    "name": "Snaggle Wrench",
    "personality": "Cynical and resourceful, Snaggle Wrench always has a snarky comment ready, but he also knows how to keep old tech running, making him invaluable in the right situation. Despite living in a toxic wasteland, he is still willing to lend a flipper to those who need one.",
